# Patches build/mproton-build.sh applies to the mach9 checkout
# (work/mach9/scripts), in this order, with `git apply`. Paths are relative
# to the mproton repository root. All are made against MACH9_COMMIT in
# build/pins.env; a mach9 bump has to re-check them (`git apply --check`).
#
# 1. LOADER_ADHOC=1: sign the loader ad hoc instead of with a provisioning
#    profile. Local use only, with SIP and AMFI relaxed (docs/m0-baseline.md).
signing/mach9-adhoc-loader.patch
# 2. build-fex.sh stages FEX through a DESTDIR, so FEX's AppConfig no longer
#    goes to /usr/local/share/fex-emu. Upstreamable as is.
build/mach9-patches/0002-fex-stage-data-under-destdir.patch
# 3. DXVK as a third Direct3D tree of each family (lib/wine/dxgi/dxvk,
#    lib/wine/d3d9/dxvk) when DXVK_DIST is set, and `dxvk` as a compatdb value.
build/mach9-patches/0003-dxvk-backend-trees.patch
# 4. make -k for Wine's builds: one failing build lists every error instead
#    of only the first, so fixes can be batched (docs/building.md).
build/mach9-patches/0004-wine-make-keep-going.patch
